<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Inscription confirmee</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#edf3ea;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#163127;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background:#edf3ea;padding:24px 12px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="max-width:680px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(22,49,39,0.12);">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:18px 28px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1f6f54 0%,#5f9f45 100%);color:#ffffff;">
              <div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0.85;">Ardhi Evenements</div>
              <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700;">Inscription confirmee</div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;max-width:520px;">
                Votre place est reservee pour <strong>{{ evenement.titre }}</strong>.
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:30px 28px 18px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;">
                Bonjour {{ participation.utilisateur.prenom }} {{ participation.utilisateur.nom }},
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#385447;">
                Nous sommes ravis de confirmer votre inscription. Vous trouverez ci-dessous un recapitulatif clair pour preparer votre participation.
              </p>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 10px;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="width:165px;padding:14px 16px;background:#f3f7ef;border-radius:14px 0 0 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#557063;text-transform:uppercase;">Evenement</td>
                  <td style="padding:14px 16px;background:#f8fbf7;border-radius:0 14px 14px 0;font-size:15px;color:#173127;">{{ evenement.titre }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="width:165px;padding:14px 16px;background:#f3f7ef;border-radius:14px 0 0 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#557063;text-transform:uppercase;">Lieu</td>
                  <td style="padding:14px 16px;background:#f8fbf7;border-radius:0 14px 14px 0;font-size:15px;color:#173127;">{{ evenement.lieu }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="width:165px;padding:14px 16px;background:#f3f7ef;border-radius:14px 0 0 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#557063;text-transform:uppercase;">Dates</td>
                  <td style="padding:14px 16px;background:#f8fbf7;border-radius:0 14px 14px 0;font-size:15px;color:#173127;">Du {{ evenement.dateDebut|date('d/m/Y') }} au {{ evenement.dateFin|date('d/m/Y') }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="width:165px;padding:14px 16px;background:#f3f7ef;border-radius:14px 0 0 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#557063;text-transform:uppercase;">Statut</td>
                  <td style="padding:14px 16px;background:#f8fbf7;border-radius:0 14px 14px 0;font-size:15px;color:#173127;">
                    <span style="display:inline-block;padding:7px 12px;background:#dff1d8;border-radius:999px;color:#285b2b;font-weight:700;">{{ participation.statut }}</span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 28px 28px;">
              <div style="padding:18px 20px;border-radius:18px;background:#f6efe2;color:#6b5737;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:16px;">
                Pensez a conserver cet email. Vous recevrez egalement un rappel avant la date de debut de l'evenement.
              </div>
              <p style="margin:22px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#6a8073;">
                Merci pour votre confiance,<br>
                L'equipe Ardhi
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
